// SUMMARY & STATISTICS
// ==========================================
// Total Active Tables: 45
// Removed Deprecated Tables: 9 (visits, visit_problems, visit_observations, 
//   visit_notes, visit_prescriptions, clinic_schedules, enquiries, subscribes, 
